diate"><addressbook><name>MATSUSHIMA, JYUNJI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>NAKANISHI, JYUNICHI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>NOUCHI, YOSHITERU</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TAKAGI, SATOSHI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A substantially L-shaped installation attachment (80) extending along the upper surface (10a) and back surface (10b) of an air conditioner (1) is fixed on the wall surface (72) or ceiling (71) of a room, whereupon the air conditioner (1) is engaged with the installation attachment (80) and is fixed to the installation attachment (80) using, if necessary, bolts or the like, thereby improving the installation strength and workability in installing the air conditioner.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention porte sur un accessoire (89) servant à l'installation d'un conditionneur d'air, s'étendant le long de la surface supérieure (10a) et de la surface dorsale (10b) d'un conditionneur d'air (1) et se fixant à un mur (72) ou au plafond d'une pièce. Le conditionneur s'engage dans l'accessoire auquel il se fixe si nécessaire au moyen de boulons ou autres. On renforce ainsi la résistance de l'installation et facilite le travail de montage.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></pate